#: ../../templates.rst:335
msgid "Runaway templates stop with an error too, never a crash. The limits are: syntax nested more than 100 levels deep (brackets, tags, and each link of a long chain of operators, filters or ``elif`` branches); macros, includes and recursive loops more than 200 deep; and any recursion needing more than 512 KiB of stack. A list that contains itself prints as ``[...]``, as in Python."
msgstr ""

